{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CecctbiLceW5HJnGfYfBT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014ABky1RYWoQf9FX6txpsZk","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/diytechy/.claude/projects/-Users-diytechy-Documents-ai-template/memory/ruff-0-16-skew-scaffold-lint-failures.md","content":"---\nname: ruff-0-16-skew-scaffold-lint-failures\ndescription: Nine scaffold-harness pytest failures are pre-existing ruff-0.16.5 skew, not your regression\nmetadata:\n  type: reference\n---\n\nThe ai-template full suite (`.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -n auto`) shows ~9\nfailures that are NOT a regression — they are ruff-version skew. A fresh\n`scripts/dev-setup` installs the latest ruff (0.16.5 as of 2026-09-01), newer\nthan the kit was formatted/linted against, and it flags **I001 \"Import block is\nun-sorted\"** in the demo `tests/test_demo.py` that `bootstrap.py` generates\ninline at scaffold time. Every test that scaffolds a project and runs its harness\n(which enables `lint = ruff check`, unlike this meta-repo, whose harness runs\nonly `format`) then fails at the `lint` step:\n\n- `test_check_harness.py`: test_minimal_project_is_green, test_unmarked_test_runs_in_full_tier, test_smoke_tier_runs_only_smoke_and_skips_coverage_gate, test_jobs_parallel_plan_matches_sequential, test_module_coverage_full_then_smoke_run_scopes_the_report\n- `test_dispatch.py::test_drive_end_to_end_claims_builds_merges_and_drains`\n- `test_integrate_station.py::test_claim_build_and_integrate_end_to_end`\n- `test_integrate_unload.py`: test_the_queue_gcs_a_clean_worker_worktree_end_to_end, test_the_queue_exits_nonzero_when_a_merged_branch_stays_held\n\nConfirmed pre-existing 2026-09-01 (WI-553): all reproduce identically on the\nintegration base with no working changes (verified in a throwaway `git worktree`\nat the base sha). Do NOT try to fix the scaffold demo — it's environmental\n(local ruff newer than CI's). When you see these in a full-suite run, verify the\nsignature is `I001 ... FAIL lint` on a scaffolded demo and move on; your green is\nthe rest of the suite. Related: [[dev-setup-clt-stub-false-positive]] is the\nother env-vs-code toolchain gotcha in this repo.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1274,"cache_read_input_tokens":529849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1274},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1224d915-a66e-46ad-b7b8-5a1783716521","uuid":"2956932a-857f-446f-8222-80e195ba4fae","request_id":"req_011CecctZi31BT7wzxYV14XK"}
